        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Reticule of white silk with gilt pearl embroidery in a circular floral design on one side and a bouquet of flowers on the other. It has a cast, gilt mount and is edged with plaited, gilt cord and trimmed at the corners with tassels. Lined with white silk."@en , "Silk reticule, England, ca. 1830."@en ;
